# Trusted Ed25519 public key for the pack release index (WS7, issue #22).
#
# `pack pull` verifies the `<name>.pack-release.json` signature against THIS key
# by default. The matching private key is a CI/release secret and is NEVER
# committed to the repository. Rotating the release key means replacing the
# base64 line below and re-signing published indexes.
#
# Format: the first non-comment, non-blank line is the raw 32-byte Ed25519
# public key, standard-base64 encoded.
YyocySoDbgUHhQgfNFPawtLqKqRUIXXfBkFUO4x4KDw=
